sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant C as Google Chat
  participant S as weave-chat
  participant P as Pub/Sub
  participant I as Ingestion
  participant J as Subscriptions
  participant K as Copilot

  U->>C: New chat → Weave → any message
  C->>S: interaction (Google-signed OIDC)
  S->>P: republish untouched payload
  P->>I: OIDC push
  I->>I: upsert onboarded_users
  I->>J: trigger an immediate sweep
  J->>C: create that user's Meet subscription
  I->>C: welcome card
  U->>C: "what needs my attention?"
  C->>S: interaction
  S->>P: republish
  P->>I: OIDC push
  I->>K: ask as this principal
  K-->>I: answer + tool results
  I->>C: reply in the DM
  U->>C: click "Mark done"
  S->>S: close the commitment, redraw
  S-->>C: updated card, inline
